1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,485
This is a full walkthrough of NEXUS,

2
00:00:02,525 --> 00:00:05,222
a local-first workspace
that brings projects,

3
00:00:05,262 --> 00:00:08,425
planning, knowledge and AI together.

4
00:00:08,487 --> 00:00:12,675
We will follow Alex, a student
building a campus marketplace.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,438
Alex starts each day
in the Command Center.

6
00:00:16,488 --> 00:00:20,838
It gathers risks, suggestions
and deadlines from every module,

7
00:00:20,888 --> 00:00:22,525
and ranks them on one list.

8
00:00:24,554 --> 00:00:26,892
Every item is scored out of one hundred.

9
00:00:26,942 --> 00:00:30,829
Open Why, and NEXUS lays
out the exact arithmetic:

10
00:00:30,879 --> 00:00:33,827
severity, priority and freshness.

11
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:35,442
Nothing is a black box.

12
00:00:36,554 --> 00:00:38,989
On the right is an intent classifier,

13
00:00:39,029 --> 00:00:42,467
trained for NEXUS and running
locally on this laptop.

14
00:00:42,529 --> 00:00:46,277
Type a sentence, and it names
the part of NEXUS you meant,

15
00:00:46,317 --> 00:00:47,654
with its confidence.

16
00:00:49,354 --> 00:00:51,477
Projects hold the bigger goals.

17
00:00:51,517 --> 00:00:54,314
Each one has a priority, a target date,

18
00:00:54,354 --> 00:00:57,267
and live progress
calculated from its tasks.

19
00:00:58,488 --> 00:01:00,222
Tasks are where the work happens.

20
00:01:00,262 --> 00:01:04,262
Every task carries a priority,
an estimate and a due date,

21
00:01:04,362 --> 00:01:07,112
and anything overdue is flagged in red.

22
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:11,871
The same tasks also work
as a board, from to do,

23
00:01:11,983 --> 00:01:14,721
through in progress and
blocked, to completed.

24
00:01:16,046 --> 00:01:18,081
The planner lays out Alex's day against

25
00:01:18,121 --> 00:01:20,433
the working hours Alex has declared.

26
00:01:21,667 --> 00:01:26,429
Ask for suggestions, and NEXUS finds
free slots before each deadline,

27
00:01:26,504 --> 00:01:28,804
then explains why it picked every one.

28
00:01:30,333 --> 00:01:32,971
The Risk Center is the
early-warning system.

29
00:01:33,033 --> 00:01:36,681
NEXUS scans deadlines,
workload and projects,

30
00:01:36,721 --> 00:01:40,471
and scores every risk with its
evidence and a suggested action.

31
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:46,125
Those findings become recommendations
that Alex can accept or turn down.

32
00:01:46,188 --> 00:01:50,237
NEXUS records the answer, but
never changes the work on its own.

33
00:01:51,467 --> 00:01:55,442
Knowledge keeps notes, concepts
and resources in one place.

34
00:01:55,517 --> 00:01:58,227
Here are Alex's customer
interview insights,

35
00:01:58,267 --> 00:02:00,642
ready to link to related ideas.

36
00:02:01,954 --> 00:02:05,154
Learning tracks skills,
goals and study time,

37
00:02:05,242 --> 00:02:09,017
so progress toward each target
level is always visible.

38
00:02:10,333 --> 00:02:13,946
The AI Assistant takes a
typed or spoken request.

39
00:02:14,008 --> 00:02:16,071
Ask how productive you were this week,

40
00:02:16,171 --> 00:02:20,133
and it recognises an analytics
question and points to the right page.

41
00:02:21,421 --> 00:02:23,058
Ask it to create a note,

42
00:02:23,196 --> 00:02:26,296
and it shows exactly what
it read from your sentence.

43
00:02:26,358 --> 00:02:29,196
Nothing is saved until
Alex presses Confirm.

44
00:02:30,321 --> 00:02:34,271
Confirmed. The note is
now saved in Knowledge.

45
00:02:35,638 --> 00:02:38,573
For open-ended questions there is NEXO,

46
00:02:38,612 --> 00:02:42,598
an experimental chat assistant built
on a local Qwen language model.

47
00:02:42,638 --> 00:02:45,038
Alex asks which tasks are overdue.

48
00:02:46,267 --> 00:02:50,417
NEXO looks up Alex's task list
and answers in plain English.

49
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:54,454
Anything it wants to change
still waits for Alex's approval.

50
00:02:55,804 --> 00:02:59,754
Finally, press Control K
anywhere to jump to a module,

51
00:02:59,842 --> 00:03:02,417
or to search every record Alex owns.

52
00:03:03,571 --> 00:03:06,118
NEXUS brings projects, planning,

53
00:03:06,158 --> 00:03:09,608
knowledge and AI into
one private workspace.

54
00:03:09,683 --> 00:03:10,746
Thanks for watching.

